STEP 0 -- setup: test VLAN, member 3 as master                             done
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Method: put both IXIA ports in one VLAN, and make member 3 the master so traffic
  enters the master and leaves a member, as the case's precondition draws it.
IE520(config)# vlan database
IE520(config-vlan)# vlan 100 state enable
IE520(config-vlan)# exit
IE520(config)# interface port3.0.25,port4.0.25
IE520(config-if)# switchport access vlan 100
IE520(config-if)# exit
IE520(config)# stack 3 priority 1
IE520(config)# no stack 1 priority

